  weight `D/2^n + O(ε)` on `ker H_N(K)`. (At `N = n+3` the measured weight `<Ψ|P_0|Ψ>`
  exceeds `D/2^n` by factors `1`–`12`.)
- status: CONJECTURE
- depends-on: C-152, C-089
- where-proved: none
- where-tested: task8_cnf.py
