1. Y.-A. Chen and X.-S. Gao, “Quantum Algorithms for Boolean Equation Solving and Quantum Algebraic Attack on Cryptosystems,” [arXiv:1712.06239](https://arxiv.org/abs/1712.06239), DOI 10.1007/s11424-020-0028-6.

